  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;be two roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
